# API stability annotations

Import from `dagster._annotations`. **`@experimental` does not exist** — use `@preview` or `@beta`.

| Decorator | Reject if missing |
|-----------|-------------------|
| `@deprecated` / `@deprecated_param` / `@hidden_param` | `breaking_version=` |
| `@beta_param` / `@deprecated_param` / `@hidden_param` | `param=` |

Use the decorators (not ad-hoc `preview_warning` / `deprecation_warning`) so docs banners and runtime warnings stay aligned. For internal call sites of an unstable API, use `emit_runtime_warning=False` with `subject=`.
